#basePath P0_Intro
#include "Header.leaf"

:: Preload
@function    ChapterPreload

$call SetBackground("bg/bedroom-bg.png")

:: Start
@exposed
@trigger    ChapterStart
@cutscene
// Lock all location on map
$call SetInThreadLocks()
$call DisableMapButton()

// Mark start of phase
$set global:currentPhase = 0
// Mark start of thread
$set global:currentThread = "P0_Intro"

// Sets variables for which branch the player goes to first in Phase 3 Cisco/Trour Decision to false
$set   global:ciscoFirst = false
$set   global:troutFirst = false

// Sets variable for whether player has already completed certain branches in Phase 3 to false
$set   global:stockCisco = false
$set   global:stockTrout = false

// Sets variables for which path the player decides to take first in Phase 3 Upstream/Downstream decision to false
$set global:upstreamFirst = false
$set global:downstreamFirst = false

// Sets variable that checks if the player previously visited the DNR and Army Corps to false
$set global:dnrVisited = false
$set global:corpsVisited = false

// TODO: Rest of thread here
{@You} 
       </i>I had this recurring dream, when I was a kid, about sea lamprey.</i>
       </i>I think it was something about their teeth that really got to me.</i> 
       </i>Maybe sleeping in my childhood bed again is what brought the dream back.</i> 

{@}
       You stand in front of the mirror you dented at 15, brushing your hair.
       A knock at the door. Your mom sticks her head inside. 

{@Mom}
       Ana, você tá pronta? <b>[Ana, are you ready?]</b>

{@You}
       Tou sim. <b>[Yeah, I am.]</b>

{@Mom}
       Ok. Tenha um bom dia hoje. <b>[Have a good day today.]</b> Te amo. 

{@You}
       Te amo também. 

{@}
       She steps out. 
       You put down the brush. 

{@You} 
       <i>No time like the present.</i> 
       <i>Right?</i>

//at this point we go to the sea grant building
$call SetBackground("bg/sea-grant-office-bg.png")

{@}
       An older woman waits for you by the front door. Her badge says "Program Director". //title subject to change

{@Saoirse}
       Ana, right?

{@You}
       That's me. You must be Saoirse. 
       
{@Saoirse}
       It's nice to finally meet you. I hope the move wasn't too difficult. 

{@You}
       My dorm room was pretty much empty, so it wasn't too bad. 

{@Saoirse}
       Well, I hope working with us will be a good first experience post-college. 
       Speaking of working, you'll have to get started right away.
       Local fishermen have been reporting bites on their fish. The fish they <i>can</i> catch, that is. 

{@}
       She hands you a photo. //insert photo of sea lamprey bite
       $call SetScenarioData("Scenario1")

{@You}
       Sea lamprey.

{@Saoirse}
       Yeah. This is what I need you to work on. 
       You'll be making a model of what the current sea lamprey situation looks like. 

{@You}
       I mean, I know about invasive species in general, but I don't know anything specific about sea lamprey. 
       Besides the teeth. 

{@Saoirse}
       You're in luck. There are plenty of people around here who have all the information you'll need. 
       Here, take this map. //map icon appears here maybe?
       As you learn more, you'll also gain certifications to manage the sea lamprey population. 
       $call SetTime(16)

{@You}
       That's... a lot of info. 

{@}
       She puts a hand on your shoulder.

{@Saoirse}
       I want you to be successful. I know you'll be. 

{@You}
       I hope so. 
       <i>No time like the present, huh.</i>

{@}
       You begin.
       $call EnableMapButton()

// go to map, end phase 0
// skip to end
$goto .End

:: End
@exposed
// Mark end of thread
$set global:currentThread = "NONE"
// Go to Phase 1 Hub
$goto P1_Hub.Entry
